        "Description": "Marco Abiatti is a firebrand right-wing populist running for election as Prime Minister of Italy. His sinister corruption and ties to organised crime make him a terrifying figure. Recently, Abiatti has faced a number of assassination attempts at his rallies, but ICA has determined that these attempts have been staged to enable him to make heroic poses after &quot;surviving&quot; each attempt and generate good press. Now you must take inspiration Agent, and put down this monster for good.",
